ount": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Kling_ai @chromaawards $450K+ in cash prizes? This season is going to be exciting! 🤯", "url": "https://x.com/AiwithAlyar/status/2117281854193857021"}, {"author_id": "1380769041984278530", "conversation_id": "2117229927107883219", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:57:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117269971302760931"], "id": "2117269971302760931", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Kling_ai @chromaawards Completely agree with this perspective, keeping the operational footprint lean saves so much headache.", "url": "https://x.com/eddyvustg/status/2117269971302760931"}, {"author_id": "2345059652", "conversation_id": "2117229927107883219", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:55:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117269328257261760"], "id": "2117269328257261760", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 54, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Kling_ai @chromaawards Great opportunity for AI creators to showcase their talent, gain exposure, and compete across different creative fields!", "url": "https://x.com/AI_CLIPs_Daily/status/2117269328257261760"}, {"author_id": "859077042129600516", "conversation_id": "2117229927107883219", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:51:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117268344521011577"], "id": "2117268344521011577", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 59, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Kling_ai @chromaawards The promotional credit is not available yet 👀", "url": "https://x.com/hckinz/status/2117268344521011577"}, {"author_id": "761099190919237632", "conversation_id": "2117229927107883219", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:47:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117267366887223747"], "id": "2117267366887223747", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Kling_ai @chromaawards @Kling_ai Wanna help sponsor our 12 month driving trip around the UK and Europe by branding our Porsche Cayenne? Dm for details if interested!", "url": "https://x.com/miketravels__/status/2117267366887223747"}, {"author_id": "1650358600316129282", "conversation_id": "2117229927107883219", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:22:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117261045584818482"], "id": "2117261045584818482", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 62, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Kling_ai @chromaawards That’s impressive", "url": "https://x.com/shamimai1/status/2117261045584818482"}, {"author_id": "86647020", "conversation_id": "2117229927107883219", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:21:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117260905578999826"], "id": "2117260905578999826", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Kling_ai @chromaawards Great opportunity for AI creators to showcase their storytelling skills and gain real exposure. Excited to see what this season brings!", "url": "https://x.com/felix_muller_ai/status/2117260905578999826"}, {"author_id": "18091971", "conversation_id": "2117229927107883219", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:11:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117258279177126064"], "id": "2117258279177126064", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Kling_ai @chromaawards The interesting category isn't the finished film. It's the one where you show how it was made.\n\nEvery Shaynell video starts as a Hindi lyric and ends as a 4K cut, and the character has to survive all of it. That's the part we'd put in front of a jury.\n\n#Shaynell #AIMusic https://t.co/5ZqyLk402f", "url": "https://x.com/manishs/status/2117258279177126064"}, {"author_id": "1896668083101773824", "conversation_id": "2117229927107883219", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:37:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117249633445437791"], "id": "2117249633445437791", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Kling_ai @chromaawards A Behind-the-Scenes division is a smart add. Does it count raw prompt iterations and failed takes, or only polished process cuts? The failed takes are half the story.", "url": "https://x.com/AdamTestsAI/status/2117249633445437791"}, {"author_id": "62339031", "conversation_id": "2117229927107883219", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:32:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117248397467955208"], "id": "2117248397467955208", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 77, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Kling_ai @chromaawards Love that student internships are in the mix. As a designer and photographer doing AI film work in Spain, the hard part isn't generating shots, it's keeping one look across 40 of them. Will the jury weigh visual consistency?", "url": "https://x.com/nikodemszymansk/status/2117248397467955208"}, {"author_id": "456542782", "conversation_id": "2117229927107883219", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:03:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117241208032432404"], "id": "2117241208032432404", "lang": "en", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Kling_ai @chromaawards That seems very interesting", "url": "https://x.com/iam_mian7/status/2117241208032432404"}, {"author_id": "607248243